Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:42.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《大白鲨3》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，慢点！ 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, slow poke! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要向前倾！ 不要向前倾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lean forward! Don't lean forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，长官 让我们休息一下，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Overman. Give us a break, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看小丑 穿着运动短裤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the clown in the jockey shorts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉，来吧 注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, come on. Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，姑娘们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，凯莉！ 做这项工作！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Kelly! Do the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我们一起去 去泻湖的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time we're goin' all the way into the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:04:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,泻湖是我的最爱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lagoon is my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的船 我淹没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn boat. I flooded the…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，里奇 我今晚有个约会！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Richie. I got a date tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，伙计们，开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！这是正确的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! That's right. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被选为 队友们为了你的整洁，\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been chosen as teammates for your neatness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以礼相待 所有人，你的南方恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}courtesy toward others and above all, your Southern grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里执行着装规定，\N{\fnArial\fs30}We enforce our dress code here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以留着你的头发 修剪指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}so keep your hair and nails trimmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了， 不要改变你的服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, please, don't alter your costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你安装了 你的海洋世界导游服，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you've been fitted with your Sea World guide apparel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.59,0:05:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,短裤够短了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the shorts are short enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你有脸，你就会 反铲炸薯条-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show any cheek and you'll be back shovelin' French fries-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，让我们继续欢迎 再说一遍现在都在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's continue with our welcome speech again. All together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到海洋世界，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Sea World,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最大的 海洋生物公园\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world's largest marine life park.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上下表面 我们独特的海底王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above and below the surface of our unique Undersea Kingdom…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,公园正式启用 星期六开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The park officially opens on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个星期都是，而且 继续，预告周，\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this week has been, and continues to be, preview week,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这期间家人和朋友 作为我们的客人参加海洋世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}during which family and friends attend Sea World as our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是海底王国，\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Undersea Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在建四年 花费超过3400万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}four years under construction, at a cost of more than $34 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个加压观察通道 辐射到泻湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four pressurized viewing tunnels radiate out into the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是沉没的西班牙人 加伦，约拿的海上游乐场，\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the Sunken Spanish Galleon, Jonah's Marine Fun House,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,深海珊瑚林 连接到集线器，中央控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Deepwater Coral Forest, all connected to the hub, Central Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一家豪华餐厅 还有鸡尾酒厅，\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a deluxe restaurant and cocktail lounge,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在水面下40英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}all 40 feet below the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个建筑群都建成了 在我们的人工湖里，\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole complex is built in our manmade lagoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接到开放的 通过深水航道的海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is connected to the open ocean by a deepwater channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋世界的新增加 是个聪明的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new additions to Sea World are the brainchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业家卡尔文？布沙尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}of entrepreneur Calvin Bouchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，伙计们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以关上门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can close the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥夫曼，我以为你说过 那些铁轨很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overman, I thought you said those tracks were secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计们，我焊接了 那该死的东西我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey guys, I welded the damn thing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,门上挂着什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's hung the gate up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好把迈克？布罗迪弄出去 孩子，他会生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get Mike Brody out here. Boy, is he gonna be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是泻湖 准备转弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the lagoon. Set up for the turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提醒你注意 对于海洋世界的滑雪者来说，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call your attention to the Sea World skiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将 进入泻湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are about to enter the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在 开幕式\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a preview of the opening day ceremonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的骄傲和快乐来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here come my pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能 有机会和布查德先生谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna get a chance to talk to Mr. Bouchard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很漂亮真漂亮！ - 嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beautiful. Just beautiful! - Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，我们希望 避免提及他丰富多彩的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would, however, like to avoid references to his colorful past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,海底王国 真的花了3000万美元？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the Undersea Kingdom really cost $30 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孩子不是很好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't those kids great?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,布查德先生，有什么事吗 特别是在开放日吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bouchard, is there anything speciai goin' on openin' day?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午， 在大门口，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this afternoon, at the main gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很高兴宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be pleased to announce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 菲茨罗伊斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}the welcomin' of Mr. Philip FitzRoyce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，真的吗？是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really? Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别撒谎，孩子们他会来的 现在，我们在酒吧有饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}No lie, boys and girls. He gonna be here. Now, we got drinks at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自由了来吧， 跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They free. Come on, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥夫曼，看起来怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overman, what's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它偏离了轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's off the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，但她被卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell, but she is jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是关不上，迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wouldn't close, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人敲了 狗娘养的马上离开跑道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somethin' knocked the son-of-a-bitch right off the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，看只是安全 该死的大门，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look. Just secure the damn gate, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能应付吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是加班费\N{\fnArial\fs30}On overtime, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是正点时间？ 你加班够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight time maybe? You got enough overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的派对 你买啤酒吧，布罗迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your party. You buy the beer, Brody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，听着，你负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, you're in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿见我得到了 更重要的事情要做-\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you guys later. I got more important things to do-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不加班\N{\fnArial\fs30}No overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以再见，迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. See you, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.42,0:08:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准加班！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No overtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准加班！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No overtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦啊嘿，丹 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Ah. Hey, Dan. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有门问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Havin' gate problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚试过 再打开一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dolphins tried to open them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和沙姆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's up with Shamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，辛迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，桑迪来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sandy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，利兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老板的安全帽 你的靴子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the boss hard hat. Where's your boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只穿它们睡觉 在洗澡的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wear 'em to bed and in the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯在哪？ 她在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Kay? She's down that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea-haw.!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑着他们，牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ride 'em, cowgirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，迈克！ 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mike! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和你在一起 马上，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be with you in a minute, darlin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.09,0:09:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的马刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your spurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，利兹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy. That was nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,利兹，他做得很好 我不想再这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz, he did that great. I don't wanna do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把辛迪和桑迪放在泻湖里 快跑，好吗？他们越来越胖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put Cindy and Sandy in the lagoon for a run, okay? They're getting fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做？ 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you dam"? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.45,0:10:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，孩子 那是喂食的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, kiddo. That's the feeding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是鲸鱼吗 房子坏了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this whale house-broken yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就不能来吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he can't come to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我去吃饭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You takin' me to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，很快我们 去接我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, soon as we pick up my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩什么时候来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's Sean coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在公园的穿梭机上我们是 在大门口等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on a park shuttle. We're gonna meet him at the main gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，凯西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪和桑迪不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cindy and Sandy don't wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，我会失去你 几条神经质的鱼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, am I gonna lose you to a couple of neurotic fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哺乳动物 哺乳动物哺乳动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mammals. Mammals. Mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有什么东西 去窃听他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something seems to be bugging 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，听着 现在是他们的游戏时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, listen. It's their play time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不想要，他们会 明天求我们把它们放上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't want it, they'll be beggin' us tomorrow. Put 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必乞求\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去吃晚饭吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take me to dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧我们尝尝寿司吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's try sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克！ 我要换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike! I'll change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 谁是好孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Who's a good boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好孩子吗？ 是的，你是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a good boy? Yes, you're a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得到一条鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you get a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们，他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, here he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，菲利普先生 菲茨罗伊斯，有首都\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, Mr. Philip FitzRoyce, with a capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来拍我们的，认识我们 住院日科研人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}is here to film us, meet our resident day scientific staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这是什么？ 哦，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's this? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普大帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip the Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，我可以组合 愉快地做生意，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, of course, able to combine business with pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我 幸福长寿的秘诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, they tell me, is the secret to a long and happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，菲茨罗伊斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, FitzRoyce?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，女士们先生们，请继续 如果你愿意的话，可以在酒吧里提问\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, ladies and gentlemen, any further questions, in the bar, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次 谁买的，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first one who buys one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看卡尔文最好的朋友 啊，最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at Calvin. Best of buddies. Ah, best of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个普通的巴纳姆和贝利\N{\fnArial\fs30}A regular Barnum and Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他们会的 在一起很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they'll be very happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很完美 嗯-嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入海底 他们去的王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the Undersea Kingdom they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，米奇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mikey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿新的嘿 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. new Hey' om!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？ 好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doin'? All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥，那个牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, the cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！拥抱我，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hug me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，好吧 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Okay. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体重增加了，你需要一个 刮胡子你就太高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put on weight, you need a shave and you're too tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分之二 我能修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, two out of three I can fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上那个装备，我们走 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that gear and let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，漂亮的靴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, nice boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！哦，天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks! Aw, gee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信我竟然那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even believe I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你期末考试考得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you do on your finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的绅士 不完整，但我比Phys好预计起飞时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. A gentleman's an incomplete, but I aced Phys. Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个真正的爱因斯坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你来了，伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, Charlene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔比出现了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shelby showed up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉真的 把这个放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly's really gettin' this one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那边那个大个子了吗？他 每天晚上都会被打屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that big guy over there? He gets knocked on his ass every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，查理 好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Charlene. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你 和我一起工作，和我一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me help you out. Work with me, work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.51,0:14:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 等待再一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Wait. One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，迈克 好吧是啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike. All right. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔比在加班吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Shelby workin' overtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我说的他应该 别跟其他人说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on my say-so. He was supposed to knock off with the rest of the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过我弟弟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you met my kid brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他搞砸了 在纪念品摊上撒尿，\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's messin' around with that little bitch down at the souvenir stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是他的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna be his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙琳，我不是他妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlene, I'm not his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're his boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，问问伍德伯里，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, ask Woodbury, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，凯莉 你能做到的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kelly. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，他们 对峙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, they're playing stand-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥认为自己是 新英格兰的杰出冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother considers himself to be the stand-off champion of New England.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及西部各州\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the western states.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我还没准备好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I wasn't ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你， 这是一场平衡的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, it's a game of balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你他会摔倒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you he'd fall on his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这家伙是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:15:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给啤酒的 你买了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for beers. You buyin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？ 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的苍蝇开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fly's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不公平！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，呃，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是一场平衡游戏， 这是一场骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}not only a game of balance, it's a game of deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，我给你们买两个 为了你欠我的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'll buy you two for the one you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见，凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我要你来吧， 马上！走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I want you. Come on, right now! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳，迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认识吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到我哥哥把你钉死了，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see my brother nailed you, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟？是啊， 信不信由你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother? Yeah, believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不拉那么老的话 裤裆魔术，他永远不会赢-\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wouldn't have pulled that old crotch trick, he never would have won-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他最好的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his best move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:16:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在家里跑步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喝什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we drinkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟 工人阶级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne of the working classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒你呢 欠我一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer. And you owe me a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是战斗 启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fight. Comm' up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,两杯啤酒所以，你工作 在公园，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two beers. So, you work at the park, huh'?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯-嗯 我是滑水运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm. I'm a water skier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊他和凯瑟琳 一起呆了一年半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Him and Kathryn have, uh, been together for a year and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperately unattached.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤独，困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonely, confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,慷慨而爱有缺点 都在我眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Generous and loving to a fault. It's all in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 男23好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come On. - MAN 23 Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会警察很多 今晚真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll cop a lot of good stuff tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,车在这儿还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the van okay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是海洋世界的财产 没人用这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're off Sea World property. Nobody uses this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:17:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻过篱笆，然后 放轻松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb over the fence, and take it easy with the raft.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要把它全部拖走 去水里的路！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we gotta drag it all the way down to the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以谁付钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Who's payin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out. Snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，来吧 别胡说我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. Don't bullshit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡肉，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，划桨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, paddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到中心去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go out to the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望这是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure hope this is worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，凯莉，这是你的车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kelly, is this your car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Get off of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想散散步吗？是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna take a walk? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小弟弟呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what about baby brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！ 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aww! Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利，你能载他一程吗 回家，还是给他妈妈打电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, can you give him a ride home, or shall I call his mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，如果他能安静地来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, if he'll come quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能我又叫又叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. I scream and shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪，外面真臭 我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, it stinks out here. Let's get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我们去游泳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's go swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我讨厌大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I hate the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！嘿，我有 更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aww! Hey, I've got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,像泻湖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like lagoons?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,泻湖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lagoons?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,泻湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lagoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦为什么肖恩 不多看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. How come Sean doesn't visit more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他讨厌水 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hates the water. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊记得我说过的鲨鱼袭击 你是说我们小时候和睦相处吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Remember that shark attack I told you about when we were kids in Amity?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才去 去科罗拉多上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's why he goes to school in Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们的父母不住在岛上， 我想他不会淋湿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our parents didn't live on an island, I don't think he'd ever get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸，他也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad, he's the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪，我爱这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌当 我们第一次来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated it when we first came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接到电话了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get a telephone call?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,委内瑞拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venezuela?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我必须 开始学西班牙语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm gonna have to start learning Spanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，宝贝 是啊是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, baby. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's wonderful. That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,多长时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,短短一年半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a short year and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能来，你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love you to come, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那六个呢 我还剩下几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about the six months I've got left here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作开始了 在斯克里普斯学院？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the job opening up at the Scripps Institute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么办？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.37,0:21:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单放弃吧 你的生活跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple. Just give up your life and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我很高兴 为你林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm happy for you. lam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-ha. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我不下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't go in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.18,0:22:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不游泳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.52,0:22:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,连朋友都没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even with friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，呃，lswim 我只是，呃，我一、 …\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, lswim. I just, uh, I… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的 发生在我小时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something that happened when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.61,0:22:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是，我不下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, I don't go in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌我能克服 你童年的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I can overcome your childhood fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.79,0:23:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.09,0:23:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的靴子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.39,0:23:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们赶走，牛仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick 'em off, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.69,0:23:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧，肖恩 很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in, Sean. It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.49,0:23:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下面的某个地方 是最好的珊瑚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere down there is the best coral.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈阿密的人会给我们 好东西200美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy in Miami will give us $200 for the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放进篮子里 我把它拉上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it in the basket. I'll pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.44,0:24:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，兰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hurry, Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.25,0:24:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢晚上的公园 太冷清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this park at night. It's so deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊太安静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那不是凯利的车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Isn't that Kelly's car?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.25,0:24:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,停，停，停 嘘！等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop, stop. Shh! Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.80,0:24:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.68,0:24:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.25,0:25:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.92,0:25:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把他弄下水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got him in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.09,0:25:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要低估 权力，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never underestimate the power, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你，在水里你是 侵犯海洋世界的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention. You, in the water. You are trespassing on Sea World property.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.65,0:25:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你的 双手举过头顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out of the water with your hands raised high above your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.74,0:25:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我哥哥在这里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. My brother works here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.58,0:25:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，我是凯莉？安？布可夫斯基， 来自滑雪队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm Kelly Ann Bukowski, from the ski team.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.66,0:25:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们火鸡有身份证吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turkeys have any ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.79,0:25:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克？凯？ 兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike? Kay? Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.30,0:25:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛角先生看到了一切， 全都知道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bullhorn sees all, knows all!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead is what you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.64,0:26:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把手放好 对你自己来说，年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep your hands to yourself, young m…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.47,0:26:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给，拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.93,0:26:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yell for mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.40,0:26:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来，该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish up down there, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.57,0:26:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，兰迪 我们得离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Randy. We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.49,0:26:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.30,0:26:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.73,0:26:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个骗子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是 你是！死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you are! Dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.32,0:27:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人可以睡 在早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guys can sleep in in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.74,0:27:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有些人得早点上班 早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us have to be at work early. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中的一些人不需要照看孩子 公园里到处都是蛞蝓和鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us don't have to baby-sit a park full of slugs and fishes either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.04,0:27:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我们就像蛞蝓和鱼一样生活 早上好，麦琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we just live like slugs and fishes. Good morning, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条狗不在柜台上吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog does not eat on the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.05,0:27:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你的湿衣服 在烘干机里，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put your wet clothes in the dryer, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.47,0:27:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 嗯我们吃什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Mmm. What are we eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.68,0:27:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.06,0:27:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这是我的呼机吗 还是你的呼机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is this my beeper or your beeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.31,0:27:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我用这个传呼机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'll use this beeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那个传呼机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use that beeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.65,0:27:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后再跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.73,0:27:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我的呼机 叫你的呼机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have my beeper beep your beeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.44,0:27:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我的呼机 传呼你的传呼机回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have my beeper beep your beeper back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.70,0:27:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.37,0:27:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它扔到我的眼睛里， 它会工作得更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just throw it in my eyes, it'll work faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.33,0:27:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，就是这样 当你熬夜的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well that's what happens when you stay up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.25,0:27:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决你的问题 儿童恐惧症\N{\fnArial\fs30}workin' out your childhood phobias.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.42,0:27:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是正确的开玩笑 你的小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Make fun of your baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.59,0:28:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就要这么做了 昨晚在水里，\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was this close to doing it in the water last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么近，嗯？ 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This close, huh? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对不起我没有 知道是治疗-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't know it was therapy-
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.10,0:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 你把我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just admit it. You messed me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.48,0:28:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认 我把你搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admit it. I messed you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吗 你和凯瑟琳之间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right between you and Kathryn?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.70,0:28:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.66,0:28:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.45,0:28:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文，我有我的船员 就在昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin, I had my crew on that yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.08,0:28:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我知道我不想 这也会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know. I don't want that to happen either.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，好吧加尔文， 我马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Okay. Calvin, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.47,0:28:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.64,0:28:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去上班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.01,0:28:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，再好不过了！ 真正地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can't do better than that! Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.48,0:28:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊是啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.69,0:28:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是好女孩？ 那是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's a good girl? That's my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.23,0:29:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.99,0:29:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪和桑迪怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are Cindy and Sandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，辛迪没事， 但桑迪还是很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Cindy's okay, but Sandy's still nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.58,0:29:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要放弃，丹尼 他可以走得更高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't quit, Danny. He can go higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.50,0:29:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.34,0:29:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，姑娘们 有我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, girls. There are my girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.13,0:29:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您来吧 准备出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Come on. Ready and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.26,0:29:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.85,0:29:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？准备好了吗？ 我说走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? You ready? I said go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.48,0:29:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些是最好的行为， 我不想看到最坏的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}If those are the best behaviors, I'd hate to see the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.53,0:29:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking for somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.36,0:29:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不认为你能我是 寻找有权威的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think you can. I'm looking for someone in authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我是摩根医生， 高级生物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm Dr. Morgan, the senior biologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.74,0:29:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.37,0:29:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.21,0:30:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很迷人菲茨罗伊斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming. Philip FitzRoyce.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.46,0:30:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你 我知道你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you. I know your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.30,0:30:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在遵守海洋法 去年夏天一起开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were at that Law of the Sea Conference together last summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.55,0:30:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是的，没错赫尔辛基 拯救鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes, that's right. Helsinki. Save the Whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.60,0:30:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我塑造成英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made a hero out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.01,0:30:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，你知道吗 我不明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what I never understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.35,0:30:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要撞车 那个日本捕鲸船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you ram that Japanese whaler?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.39,0:30:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他进来了 我的方式，毁了我最好的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he got in my way, ruined my best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.90,0:30:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊我印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I was impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.74,0:30:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好也许我们可以 今晚喝点什么晚餐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then perhaps we can have a drink and some dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.91,0:30:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对不起，菲茨罗伊斯先生，但是， 我就是不这么做-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry, Mr. FitzRoyce, but, that's a behavior I just don't do-
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.75,0:30:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,旋转得很好，丹尼我会见面的 你在储藏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice spins, Danny. I'll meet you at the holding tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.84,0:30:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿水女孩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}HEY. aqua girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.38,0:30:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，迈克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.43,0:30:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.27,0:31:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不睡觉， 他不住在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He don't sleep in, he don't live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我告诉谢尔比？奥夫曼 他能飞起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Shelby Overman for me he can take a flyin' leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.24,0:31:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个面包圈上 碎石车道，听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a rollin' doughnut on a gravel driveway, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.37,0:31:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下没有 他昨晚回家了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it just a second. Didn't he come home last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.24,0:31:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没出现在这里 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't show up here either. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.37,0:31:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他回家的时候已经醉醺醺的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure he's home hung over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.66,0:31:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你，那个男人的垃圾，我 别让他在我家附近！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, the man's trash, and I don't want him around my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了 你拿走他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone. You take his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.21,0:31:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,查琳，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlene, what's goin' on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔比？奥夫曼又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shelby Overman's AWOL again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.38,0:31:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.59,0:31:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，这都是他的东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, is this all his stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.72,0:31:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Doesn't figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.22,0:31:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把护照和 还有他的信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left his passport and his… And his credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.77,0:31:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾照，当票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driver's license, pawn tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.31,0:31:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不可能 计划太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he could have been planning to go too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.31,0:31:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为 他出事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think something happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.86,0:31:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，难道 警方已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, wouldn't the police have called…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.44,0:31:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不，看他蜷缩着 起来，在某个地方喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, look. He is curled up, drunk someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.53,0:31:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我找到他时， 他有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I find him, he's in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.07,0:31:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我们会让你 我们一听到什么就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry. We'll let you know as soon as we hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.28,0:31:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想帮我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.33,0:31:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊小心点，查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Take care, Charlene.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.37,0:31:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我看看泻湖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me look in the lagoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.45,0:32:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我生那个老男孩的气了， 但我不是故意伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm mad at that old boy, but I don't mean him any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.13,0:32:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？ 我不是故意伤害他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? I don't mean him any harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往下一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,转动它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.60,0:32:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池是 充满电了，迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batteries are fully charged, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.65,0:32:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.73,0:32:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.44,0:32:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水控制室 正在进入泻湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control room, submersible is now entering the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.95,0:32:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰我可以监视 从这里开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger. I can monitor it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.82,0:32:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试，一个， 二，三你能读懂我吗，凯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Testing, one, two, three-Can you read me, Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.95,0:32:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了 沟通很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read you. Communication's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了沙琳， 我真希望他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Charlene's sake, I sure hope he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.38,0:32:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪还是桑迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Cindy or Sandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.76,0:32:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么做 把它们分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to tell them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.72,0:32:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯”辛迪要大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}KAY". Cindy's a lot larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制，这是第一次冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, this is Venture One.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.03,0:33:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在25英尺的地方 西班牙大帆船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at 25 feet, headed for the Spanish Galleon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可以见到你了 嗨，迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you now. Hi, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.10,0:33:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥夫曼违反了潜水员的规则 昨晚，在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overman broke divers' rules last night, out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.81,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被戴上镣铐 只有海门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went down to shackle the sea gate alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.48,0:33:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他出了什么事，大海 水流会把他冲到这里来，\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happened to him, the ocean current would have washed him up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.02,0:33:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝向泻湖的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}toward the center of the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.11,0:33:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,过滤管呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the filtration pipes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:34:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，太强了a 电流向相反方向移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's too strong a current moving the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.33,0:34:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，所有的流程 进入泻湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the flow's all into the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一百万加仑 每小时提供新鲜盐水\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a million gallons of fresh salt water every hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他应该 被困在西班牙大帆船里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he could have gotten trapped in the Spanish Galleon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.13,0:34:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本来可以 困在上层建筑中\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have gotten caught in the superstructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.55,0:34:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,会留下他 从浮式平台上部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have kept him from floating topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克！哦，天哪 我想……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike! Oh, God. For a second I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.10,0:34:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，是的我知道 我们叫他奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. I know it. We call him Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.45,0:34:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在这里，凯我将进入 加隆，仔细看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here, Kay. I'll go into the galleon and take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.41,0:34:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，呃，迈克 我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh, Mike. I'm goin' with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.37,0:34:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的海豚！什么 他们到底在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn dolphins! What the hell are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.67,0:34:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们已经 最近两天表现得很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. They've been acting strange for the last two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.71,0:34:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.18,0:35:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制，我们离开潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, we're leaving the sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.69,0:35:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将失去无线电联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be out of radio contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.31,0:35:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你说， 摩根博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read you, Dr. Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.81,0:35:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你的腹肌瓶， 凯我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your ABS bottles, Kay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.32,0:35:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯”好的，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}KAY". Okay, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走！ - 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.48,0:37:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克！快点！迈克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike! Quick! Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.54,0:37:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门！去开门！ 鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gate! Get the gate! Shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.33,0:37:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊！V发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Vvhat' s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.43,0:37:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，该死！接近！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close, damn it! Close!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.18,0:37:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！你没事吧？ 那是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Are you okay? What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.56,0:37:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！那是什么？ 你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! What is that? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.19,0:37:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱人 哈登菲尔德的第16位伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guv'nor's the 16th Earl of Haddenfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.15,0:38:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,与第一个握手 海洋世界的加尔文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shake hands with the first Calvin of Sea World.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.53,0:38:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,附魔附魔他 你也懂法语吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchante. Enchante. He Know French too, huh'?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.32,0:38:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，先生们 布查德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, gentlemen. Mr. Bouchard…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.61,0:38:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我们在这里吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. We're havin' dinner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.53,0:38:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这最好是重要的 是的，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be important. It is, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克和摩根医生 被叛变的鲨鱼追赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike and Dr. Morgan were pursued by a renegade shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.45,0:38:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它进入了我们的泻湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}that got into our lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.87,0:38:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要，先生们 最好跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is important, gentlemen. Better come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.55,0:38:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，卡尔文， 这是一个伟大的白色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, Calvin, it was a great white.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.05,0:38:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它大约有十英尺长 表现出典型的进食模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was about ten feet long, it was exhibiting a typical feeding pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.05,0:38:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们身上，卡尔文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}On us, Calvin!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该死的东西想喂我们 例如\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damn thing tried to feed on us. Exacfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.72,0:38:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看 它在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.22,0:38:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.81,0:38:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.02,0:38:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗，卡尔，这个 可能是运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Cal, this could be a stroke of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.74,0:38:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们杀了这个野兽 在摄像机上，\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we kill this beastie on camera,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以向你保证 媒体报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can guarantee you media coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.62,0:38:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他引到集结地，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lure him into a staging area,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.08,0:38:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在此时此刻， 把他的肚子剖开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and at the precise moment, slit his belly wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.42,0:39:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.50,0:39:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试着阻止他，伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try and stop him, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.84,0:39:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是这样挣钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we earn our bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.43,0:39:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，杰克过于简单化了 像往常一样重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Jack is oversimplifying matters, as is usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.10,0:39:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，是的，我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.47,0:39:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！ - 没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.60,0:39:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思，不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.65,0:39:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是不是 你们中的任何一个，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know if it's occurred to any of you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.94,0:39:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有一个很好的白色 被囚禁在任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there isn't a great white alive in captivity anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.78,0:39:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，我们是独一无二的， 卡尔文，你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're unique here, Calvin, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.49,0:39:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果任何设施可以 保持白色，是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any facility can maintain a white, it's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.45,0:39:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能射他，让他安静下来， 我们可以把他放进一个贮槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could dart him, tranquilize him, we could get him in a holding tank…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.25,0:39:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！这太疯狂了， 这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it! This is crazy, this is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.04,0:39:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,白鲨是杀手 我认识他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}White sharks are killers. I know 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.63,0:39:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲，我兄弟，我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father, my brother, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.26,0:39:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是杀人犯不，凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're murderers. No, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.17,0:39:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文，他们死得很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin, they die magnificently.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.60,0:40:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是一个壮观的事件 毫无疑问，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would really be a spectacular event. No doubt about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.31,0:40:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在做什么，卡尔文， 策划网络特辑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing, Calvin, planning a network special?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.40,0:40:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我们可以 成为地球上的第一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you realize that we could be the first people on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.61,0:40:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个伟大的白人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have a great white alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.32,0:40:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的丈夫 小姐，先去拿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if my guv'nor gets it first, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.87,0:40:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说他杀了它 好吧，就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Say he kills it. Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.75,0:40:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪打完就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one shot, over, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.67,0:40:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一个活生生的白人现在， 你想想看，卡尔文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a live great white. Now, you think about that, Calvin!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.05,0:40:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚间新闻 鲨鱼杀手的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightly bulletins on the progress of the killer shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.64,0:40:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们护理它的照片 恢复健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pictures of us nursing it back to health.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.93,0:40:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,降低它 进入一个储存罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lowering it into a holding tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.43,0:40:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，这是世界新闻！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's world news!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.81,0:40:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想门口的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the lines at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.23,0:40:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就错过了 杀人的运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you miss the sport of the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.52,0:40:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，等等，杰克 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait up, Jack. Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.94,0:40:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮是媒体的保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing is guaranteed press.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.44,0:40:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但另一个很重要， 更有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this other is much, much more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.25,0:41:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以， 我是MS-222\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is MS-222.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.05,0:41:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奎纳定，但我有 估计剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is quinaldine, but I had to guesstimate the dosage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.05,0:41:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.68,0:41:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确的谢谢，丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Thanks, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.18,0:41:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我们准备好了 掌控一切你们都准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're ready in Control. You all set?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.56,0:41:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.56,0:41:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，有了这些 电视监视器滚动，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, with those TV monitors rolling,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.61,0:41:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有更多的报道 比这附近的太空发射更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have more coverage than a space launch around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.69,0:41:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好就像我喜欢的那样 正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Just the way I like it. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.07,0:41:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你湿衣服的颜色 一个地狱般的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The color of your wet suit's one hell of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.20,0:41:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼会爱你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shark's gonna love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.61,0:41:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.99,0:41:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它帮助我 拍特写镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helps me get the close-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.62,0:41:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是表演家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the showman.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.62,0:41:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，你觉得这个 西装能保护你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you think this suit's gonna protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.12,0:41:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗？ 你有没有感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? Have you felt the…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.58,0:41:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它咬不穿， 但它会屈服于压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't bite through, but it will yield to pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.50,0:41:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她可能会 稍微挤一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she might just get a little squeeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.38,0:41:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，真是个好消息听着， 你为什么要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's great news. Look, why do you have to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不让女王陛下 一号儿子搞定，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you let Her Majesty's number one son take care of it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.97,0:42:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我的工作，记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's my job, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.64,0:42:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，但我只是不 希望是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I just don't want it to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.43,0:42:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，所有的东西都是你造的，我游泳 在里面就是这样对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you build all the stuff, I swim around in it. That was the deal. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.31,0:42:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐马尔可夫模型？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.11,0:42:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.49,0:42:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们遇到任何麻烦 我们要做的就是拔出别针\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get into any trouble, all we have to do is pull the pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.75,0:42:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些是什么？ - 米尔斯炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are those? - Mills bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.37,0:42:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？ 米尔斯炸弹，桑尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Mills bombs, sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.79,0:42:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,手榴弹女王陛下的一个小伙子 军械弥补了rne的不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenades. A chap in Her Majesty's ordnance makes them up for rne.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.30,0:42:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小克莱莫尔斯- 良好的水平分散性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby claymores- Good horizontal dispersion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.05,0:42:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些脑震荡有点粗糙 鼓膜，但它们起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some concussion. A bit rough on the eardrums, but they do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.05,0:42:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，不是在我的水里 把它们取下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not in my water. Take 'em off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.81,0:42:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢编织，我的 亲爱的，我会照顾我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tend to your knitting, my dear, and I shall tend to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.39,0:42:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Hold on a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.06,0:42:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有 任何水下爆炸物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not gonna be any explosives underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.06,0:42:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面是丙烯酸树脂， 这是一个非常脆弱的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's acrylic down there, it's a very fragile environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.57,0:42:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.15,0:42:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，布罗迪，我知道 这是保险……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Brody, I do inderstand. This is insurance…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.15,0:42:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不认为你 理解我，菲茨罗伊斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think you understood me here, FitzRoyce!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.66,0:43:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了两年时间做这个 停车，我不去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent two years building this park, and I'm not gonna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.03,0:43:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个消防队员 自制炸弹把它炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}some visiting fireman with a homemade bomb blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是因为他想 杀了一条鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}just because he wants to kill a fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.21,0:43:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文，你是 听着这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin, are you listening to all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.33,0:43:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有手榴弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No grenades.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.17,0:43:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上，古诺 还记得澳大利亚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake, guv'nor. Remember Australia?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，别担心，杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.47,0:43:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟，只是 一条小鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, it's only a little fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.06,0:43:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.31,0:43:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须拔出销子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pin has to be pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.27,0:43:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确的摆脱 这些东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Get rid of this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.02,0:43:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上所有人？ 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody aboard here? Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.03,0:43:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shove off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.59,0:43:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个干净的腹部注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need one clean belly shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.84,0:44:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我错过了第一关， 我得重新加载\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I miss on the first pass, I'm gonna have to reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.72,0:44:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我能抓住他 用第二个飞镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just hope I get him with the second dart.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.01,0:44:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个很好的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a good place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.89,0:44:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.48,0:44:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跳舞好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.28,0:44:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，为什么不呢？我开始觉得 就像理查德国王参加十字军东征一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why not? I'm beginning to feel like King Richard going to the Crusades.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.66,0:44:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗，杰克？ 去拿装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready, Jack? Get the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.00,0:44:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,棕色面包，古夫纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brown bread, guvnor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.38,0:44:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.05,0:44:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.06,0:45:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你只有一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you only get one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.64,0:45:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.23,0:45:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Kathryn?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.99,0:45:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会粘在鲨鱼身上击中 她，然后就过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll stick in the shark. Hit her, and it'll go right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.11,0:45:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他振作起来， 让他慢下来，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just buoy him up, slow him down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.20,0:45:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,背鳍，背部中部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorsal fin, middle of the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.34,0:46:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.00,0:46:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我们会抓住他的 在监视器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll get him on the monitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.51,0:46:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！迈克， 他跑了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Mike, he's making a run!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.68,0:46:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，开枪打他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.89,0:47:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.11,0:47:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.82,0:47:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开，凯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way, Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.49,0:47:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.35,0:47:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.93,0:47:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确的给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.77,0:47:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了，宝贝 你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, baby. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.23,0:47:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是梯子 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the ladder. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.56,0:47:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 把你的鳍给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Give me your fins.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.94,0:47:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的鳍给我 我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your fins. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.82,0:47:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.40,0:47:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.16,0:47:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后面关上一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close one back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.41,0:47:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们把这些东西从她身上拿下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this stuff off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.62,0:47:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯，太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, that was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.71,0:48:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是什么，该死的搬运工？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I, a bloody porter?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.04,0:48:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙怎么样 用这个硬件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a hand with this hardware?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.67,0:48:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，第一件事，杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, first things first, Jacko.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.13,0:48:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能忽视女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mustn't ignore the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.00,0:48:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忽视 救命恩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't ignore the bleedin' help.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.01,0:48:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面看起来毛茸茸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked pretty hairy down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.30,0:48:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧，凯？为了 一秒钟，我很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, Kay? For a second, I was so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.64,0:48:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然知道 把我吓跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure know how to scare the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.51,0:48:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要把他包好，好吗？让他淋湿 让我们把他放进坦克里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be sure he's wrapped, okay? Keep him wet. Let's get him in a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.64,0:48:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍电影好吗？ 电视画面看起来阴云密布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Film all right? TV picture looked cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.77,0:48:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,加尔文凯瑟琳很好， 菲利普没事，杰克没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin. Kathryn's fine, Philip is fine, Jack is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.99,0:48:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹和利兹很好 我也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan and Liz are fine. I am okay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.36,0:48:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，这部电影还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, is the film okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.74,0:48:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是 一流的，卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's absolutely first-rate, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.74,0:48:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll be very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.66,0:48:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.62,0:48:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很漂亮 下面很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did look pretty dangerous down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.54,0:48:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，看起来很危险 从下面也来，卡尔文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it looked pretty dangerous from down here too, Calvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.84,0:48:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能得对付他 整晚，让他动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may have to work him all night, keep him moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.88,0:48:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来，丹尼下来，下来 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, Danny. Down, down. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.51,0:49:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须确认氧气 一直在他的腮缝里跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be sure the oxygen keeps running through his gills.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.85,0:49:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想失去他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't wanna lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.73,0:49:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上门！不管你是谁 是的，这是禁区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door! Whoever you are, this is off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.49,0:49:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,利兹，呃，把水管打开我 想给他充气吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz, uh, get the hose running. I wanna try aerating him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.53,0:49:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使对我来说， 无畏的鱼叉手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even to me, the fearless harpoonist?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.45,0:49:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.54,0:49:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧，水手 你是新来的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in, sailor. Are you new in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.21,0:49:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊过来接我 一个女人和一个纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Came by to get me a woman and a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.59,0:49:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看纹身吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna see the tattoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.05,0:49:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我宁愿去见那个女人， 看看比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd rather see the woman, get a look at the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.72,0:49:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，没有别的女人， 也没有纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, there isn't any other woman, there isn't any tattoo either.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.52,0:49:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.23,0:49:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, damn'.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.36,0:49:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的哺乳动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn mammal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.77,0:49:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条是鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.90,0:49:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条简单美丽的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple, beautiful fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.29,0:50:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.62,0:50:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克！迈克！你在做什么？ 你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike! Mike! What are you doing? Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.25,0:50:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,利兹，去远足 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz, take a hike. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.59,0:50:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是唯一的办法 我们可以在一起，\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is the only way we can be together,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法 我们可以在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the only way we can be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.84,0:50:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎上船，水手明白了 用水龙带抓住它，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard, sailor. Get that hose and hold onto it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.68,0:50:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊可以 张开嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay. Open the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.06,0:50:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你的新朋友问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hi to your new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.22,0:50:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，这是第一次 你曾经和我一起工作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this is the first time you've ever done my work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.56,0:50:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，嗯，真是太刺激了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it's a real thrill.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.61,0:50:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许明天你 可以和我一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe tomorrow you can come work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.27,0:50:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些真正的兴奋 帮我打地基\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have some real excitement help me pour foundations.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.78,0:50:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃掉！让开！ 让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away! Get clear! Get clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.70,0:50:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.95,0:50:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有给你任何信号吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't he give you any signs?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.62,0:50:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！一分钟 他死定了，\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! One minute he was dead out,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.62,0:50:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一分钟 他完全清醒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}the next minute he was wide awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.46,0:50:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有食物 没有药物治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No food. No medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.80,0:50:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是唯一被囚禁的活生生的，伙计们 让我们让他一直这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only live one in captivity, guys. Let's keep him that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.55,0:51:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵？不做任何事 那会给他带来创伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Don't do anything that's gonna traumatize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.74,0:51:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，伙计们欢迎来到 海底王国的开放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahoy, mateys. Welcome to the opening of the Undersea Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.12,0:51:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,约拿的神奇奥秘 鲸鱼，珊瑚林\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magical mysteries of Jonah and the Whale, the Coral Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.83,0:51:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及沉没的西班牙大帆船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Sunken Spanish Galleon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.59,0:51:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了，老兄！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha, guv'nor!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.02,0:51:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一头鲸鱼 大脑比大多数人都大，\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a whale with a brain larger than most folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.48,0:51:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,能赚大钱 一次装订\N{\fnArial\fs30}able to earn beaucoup bucks in a single bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.90,0:51:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯和我在潜艇里，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay and I went down in the sub,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.78,0:51:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们搜索了 整个地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we searched over all this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.44,0:52:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在鲨鱼袭击我们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the sharks hit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.78,0:52:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，但是迈克，如果奥弗曼去了 在海门的另一边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Mike, what if Overman went down on the other side of the sea gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.20,0:52:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,潮水可能 把他拉出来，\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tide might have pulled him out,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.83,0:52:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们应该去看一场人体秀 在海岸的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we should have had a body show up somewhere along the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.66,0:52:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,布罗迪，你查过了吗 过滤管？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody, did you check the filtration pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.87,0:52:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，卡尔文当前的 另一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Calvin. The current's too strong goin' the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.13,0:52:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一百万加仑的海水 每小时流入泻湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a million gallons of sea water flowing into the lagoon every hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.88,0:52:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人不负责任 当他出现时，解雇他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's irresponsible. When he turns up, fire him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.72,0:52:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，卡尔文 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, Calvin. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.72,0:52:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人他只是搞砸了 偶尔起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good man. He just messes up every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.85,0:52:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会坚持 你负责隐马尔可夫模型？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hold you responsible. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.81,0:52:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，她可以去滑雪了 因为帕蒂是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, she gets to ski by herself because Patty's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.07,0:52:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样，伦纳德？我只是 得到今天的第一份打印件\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going, Leonard? I just got today's first print-outs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.07,0:52:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天，我们的预售额是三 比我们的其他公园早了一倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, our advance sales are three times ahead of our other parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.57,0:52:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不意外，伦纳德 大白鲨现在在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unexpected, Leonard. Where's the great white now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.41,0:52:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在储藏室里我想把 他在第六泳池展出\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the tank room. I want to put him on display at pool six.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.00,0:52:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉大家 把所有的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna instruct everyone to put all that information.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.75,0:52:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所有的欢迎声中， 休息和总结\N{\fnArial\fs30}on all the welcomes, rest stops and wrap-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.75,0:52:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我以为我们要等 关于摩根博士的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought we were to wait on Dr. Morgan's word for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.75,0:53:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我经营公园，我卖 票是我决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I run the park, I sell the tickets and I make the decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.80,0:53:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把鱼挪开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.09,0:53:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想站出来 三点前排队看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be able to stand in line to see it before three.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.35,0:53:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,三下， 向上，然后转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three and down, and up, and turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.12,0:53:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在， 海洋世界滑水队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, the Sea World water ski team.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.83,0:53:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人眼花缭乱 协调与卓越\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a dazzling display of coordination and brilliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.45,0:53:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,银色子弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Silver Bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.42,0:53:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！ 很好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Lookin' good!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.00,0:53:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.85,0:53:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！直升机！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! The helicopters!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.49,0:54:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，肖恩 你真的很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sean. You were real hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.57,0:54:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were real hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.11,0:54:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让我们单独呆一会儿你 演出间隙有几分钟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want some time for us alone-You got a few minutes between shows?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.99,0:54:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 太好了，凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet. Great, Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.83,0:54:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听 准备好好玩了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. Ready for some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.50,0:54:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！ 让我们乘碰碰船吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic! Let's ride the bumper boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.54,0:54:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰碰船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bumper boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.34,0:54:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，这很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.76,0:54:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是入口 对于海底王国，\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the entrance to the Undersea Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.51,0:54:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议的情结 水下隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}an incredible complex of underwater tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.01,0:54:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看第一手资料 深渊的奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}that show you first-hand the miracles of the deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.30,0:54:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有额外费用 为了这个独特的吸引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no extra charge for this unique attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.93,0:54:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的水下隧道 不仅有趣，而且信息丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our underwater tunnels are not only fun, but informative.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.56,0:54:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.86,0:54:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在历史上被活生生地消耗掉， 约拿知道是什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consumed alive in history, Jonah found out what it was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.15,0:54:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活在 海洋是最伟大的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to live in the belly of the ocean's greatest animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.07,0:54:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们特别的约拿和鲸鱼 展览时间为11：00、1：00和4：00\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our special Jonah and the Whale showcase is at 11:00, 1:00 and 4:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.53,0:54:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在圆形剧场 在海底王国中\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the amphitheater inside the Undersea Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.84,0:55:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是船长的水槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Captain Sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.26,0:55:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的洞穴 充满乐趣和惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my cave of fun and surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.35,0:55:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，恶心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.98,0:55:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定会想念这些家伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure am gonna miss these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.81,0:55:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样，卡斯帕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout it, Casper?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.90,0:55:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想拿着钱跑 和老米奇去委内瑞拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna take the money and run to Venezuela with old Mikey?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.90,0:55:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比斯卡多安静吗？ 你会说西班牙语，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quieres un pescado? You speak Spanish, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.95,0:55:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们会 我也很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're gonna miss you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.66,0:55:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你和我必须 一次严肃的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you and I are gonna have to have a serious conversation sometime…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.91,0:55:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what's really goin' on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.08,0:55:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.25,0:55:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.88,0:55:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克？布罗迪迈克？布罗迪 请给办公室打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike Brody. Mike Brody. Call your office, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.43,0:55:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya later.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.05,0:55:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋世界， 为了纪念开幕日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea World, in honor of opening day…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.26,0:55:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，卡斯帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Casper.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.35,0:56:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a girl to do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.27,0:56:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.81,0:56:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白鲨 在6号游泳池中\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great white shark in holding pool number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.69,0:56:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看到那个 只有被囚禁的伟大白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be able to view the one and only great white in captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.78,0:56:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白鲨 在海洋深处漫游\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great white shark has roamed the ocean's depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.41,0:56:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,千百万年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}for millions of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.74,0:56:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,骄傲的动物……\N{\fnArial\fs30}A proud animal…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.25,0:56:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我哦，天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.25,0:56:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,独处时，是一个掠食者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}While alone, is a predator…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.21,0:56:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我！ 他在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me! What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.84,0:56:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文命令他搬走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin ordered him moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.96,0:56:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么不问我？为什么？ 他是一个人去的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he ask me? Why did he go ahead on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.97,0:56:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条鲨鱼，a 首次举办……\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shark, a first of its kind to be held…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.89,0:56:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，丹尼！丹尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Danny! Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.73,0:56:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,利兹，准备好水管， 我现在就给他充气！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz, get a hose ready, I wanna aerate him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.98,0:56:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，丹尼去后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Danny. Get the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.31,0:56:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人”请稍等 请保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOMAN". Just a minute. Please remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.82,0:56:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根博士和助理 我们的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Dr. Morgan and assistant members of our staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.19,0:56:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，请不要干涉 以任何方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, please don't interfere in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.49,0:56:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.91,0:56:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,利兹！利兹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz! Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.12,0:57:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.67,0:57:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样来吧 转过来，丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Come on. Turn it, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.46,0:57:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉！ 来吧快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.47,0:57:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，孩子，快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Boy, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.23,0:57:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.53,0:57:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人”让我把你的 注意其他一些事件…\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOMAN". Let me bring your attention to some other events…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.58,0:57:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.25,0:57:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豹水獭秀 当然还有……\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seal and otter show and of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.62,0:57:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.54,0:57:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.76,0:58:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进 拍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Photograph it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.73,0:58:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,留神！ 凯利凯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Kelly. Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.85,0:58:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.90,0:58:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，你会喜欢的 很有趣相信我快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you'll love it. It's fun. Trust me. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.49,0:58:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西？ 你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this thing? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.86,0:58:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？ 我们应该这么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we should be doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.07,0:58:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！哦，天哪这个能吗 抱两个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, God. Can this hold two people?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.20,0:58:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦推动推动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Push. Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.21,0:58:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪你是吗 还是我在操纵这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Are you steering this, or am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.21,0:58:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！快走！逃掉！醒悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Get away! Get awayi.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.56,0:58:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们邀请你进入魔法世界 深海珊瑚林世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We invite you to enter the magical world of the deepwater Coral Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.64,0:58:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里你可以观察到 深而不湿\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you may observe the wonders of the deep without ever getting wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.40,0:58:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙大帆船扮演主人 给无数色彩斑斓的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Spanish Galleon plays host to a myriad of colorful fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.24,0:58:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个海洋世界 世界上不同的海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Sea World has assembled from the different oceans of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.41,0:59:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们所有人！ 哦，是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all of them! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.83,0:59:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像只蝴蝶 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like a butterfly. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.80,0:59:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！ 看那个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.97,0:59:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，凯，我不认为 你想看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Kay, I don't think you want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.64,0:59:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克，大家都在假设 这是鲨鱼袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, everybody is assuming that this was a shark attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.65,0:59:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我想确定一下 可以好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wanna make sure. Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.02,0:59:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把他拉出来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you guys pull him out?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.23,1:00:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谢尔比？奥夫曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Shelby Overman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.90,1:00:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯，我告诉过 错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, I told… Miss…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.28,1:00:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike. Ray.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.37,1:00:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是鲨鱼袭击， 我以前见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this was a shark attack, I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.16,1:00:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.51,1:00:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.72,1:00:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.22,1:00:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们去找卡尔文 快点！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go find Calvin. Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.31,1:00:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变得很矛盾 过滤泵的读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting a lot of contradictory readings from the filtration pumps.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.36,1:00:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such as?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.90,1:00:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,高泵速，低流量\N{\fnArial\fs30}High pump rate, low outflow.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.57,1:01:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,压力增大 在内侧通道阀上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a pressure build-up on the inboard tunnel valve.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.99,1:01:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是第二个 可能是障碍物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's number two. Could be an obstruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.45,1:01:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，那不是我的部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not my department.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.41,1:01:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你能不能找到布罗迪 或者卡尔文，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can locate Brody or Calvin, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.54,1:01:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很时髦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very posh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.75,1:01:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，这是一个很好的展示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's quite a display.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.50,1:01:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我如何控制 在泻湖的这个地方有鲨鱼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. How do you contain the sharks in this part of the lagoon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.72,1:01:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是老鲨鱼的屏幕， 那个泡沫屏风\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that old shark screen, that bubble screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.30,1:01:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的， 鲨鱼不喜欢那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sharks don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.97,1:01:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们称之为海军陆战队 隔离\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what they call, uh, marine segregation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.85,1:01:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,布查德医生电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Bouchard. Telephone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.23,1:01:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，先生们 现在舒服点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, excuse me, gentlemen. Get comfortable now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.19,1:01:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.61,1:01:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,布查德在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bouchard here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.57,1:01:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,水泵呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the pumps?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.12,1:01:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，不，不，不 不要等布罗迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, nah, nah, nah. Don't wait for Brody.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是，呃，关掉二号泵 切换到第一位-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, shut down number two pump and switch over to number one-
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.29,1:01:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.71,1:02:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它太贵了 它们都烧坏了，这就是为什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it costs too much to replace and they burn out, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.42,1:02:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉布罗迪下来 海王星双人房，听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell Brody to get down here to the Neptune Room on the double, y'hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.05,1:02:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.15,1:02:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.15,1:02:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,下巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chin-chin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.19,1:02:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，干杯 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cheers. Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.41,1:02:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文，我有个坏消息保留 你的声音，坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin, I've got bad news. Keep your voices down, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.00,1:02:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.21,1:02:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲨鱼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it the shark?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.09,1:02:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.51,1:02:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.59,1:02:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬入半径 大约一码宽\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a bite radius about a yard across.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.35,1:02:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了这表明 大约35英尺长的鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be silly. That would indicate a shark of some 35 feet in length.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.94,1:02:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.32,1:03:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的鲨鱼还有它所有的牙齿 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our shark still has all its teeth. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.78,1:03:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说那是个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means it was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.62,1:03:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的鲨鱼 杀死了奥夫曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our shark couldn't have killed Overman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.45,1:03:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的母亲做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its mother did.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.66,1:03:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在谈论 一些该死的鲨鱼妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talkin' about some damn shark's mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.46,1:03:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文，你没听到 她在这里说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin, don't you hear what she's sayin' here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.13,1:03:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在听！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.79,1:03:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真有这样的动物，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if there is such an animal,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.38,1:03:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在海上分娩，\N{\fnArial\fs30}she gave birth way out to sea,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.09,1:03:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子在游泳 穿过海门\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the baby swam through the sea gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.42,1:03:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开着门，布罗迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you left open, Brody!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.72,1:03:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！奥夫曼被杀了 在公园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Overman was killed inside the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.14,1:03:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子被抓住了 在公园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby was caught inside the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.14,1:03:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的妈妈在公园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its mother is inside the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.28,1:03:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就在那儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.42,1:04:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西是怎么进去的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did that thing get in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.51,1:04:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物们在泻湖里！ 滑雪表演！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The animals are in the lagoon! Ski show!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.22,1:04:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心，我是布查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, this is Bouchard.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.76,1:04:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你仔细听我说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you listen to me carefully!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.10,1:04:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你清理隧道，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to clear the tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.18,1:04:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你 让人们出去，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to let the people out,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.47,1:04:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你关门 把门关上，封锁公园！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to close the gate and seal the park!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.52,1:04:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁公园！ 我马上就下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the park! I'll be down in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.23,1:04:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！小心点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.69,1:04:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那家伙是谁；？ - 小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is that guy'? - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.00,1:04:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，把它拿过来！嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bring it over here! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.34,1:04:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧我已经玩够了 我们现在进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I've had enough fun. Let's go in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.59,1:04:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧你很享受这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You're enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.47,1:05:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，听着，你不必 是在工作还是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Look, don't you have to be at work or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.31,1:05:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔米在金字塔上我没有 回到下半场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tammy's on the pyramid. I don't have to be back till the second half.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.98,1:05:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.15,1:05:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha, lovers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉！ 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.65,1:05:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出！走出！ 嘿，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out! Hey, what the?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.66,1:05:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你在干什么；？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are ya doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.62,1:05:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,布罗迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.12,1:05:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开水里 走出！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the water. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.50,1:05:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请离开水 请，从水里进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the water, please. Please, come in from the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.29,1:05:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从水里出来！快点！ 离开水！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the water! Come on! Get out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.84,1:05:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从水里出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.18,1:05:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.35,1:05:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.19,1:05:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.65,1:05:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是海洋世界控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sea World Control.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.57,1:05:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.24,1:06:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他就在我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I got him right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.54,1:06:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，孩子们 进来鞠躬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys. Come on in and take a bow.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.08,1:06:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉让你 不！快上来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize to have you… No! Get up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.00,1:06:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从水里出来！ 从水里出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta the water! Get outta the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.55,1:06:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们孩子们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys. Boys!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.89,1:06:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船拉进来！ 从水里出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the boat in! Get outta the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.60,1:06:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,您将同时获得 我们在这里开火了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get both of us fired out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.31,1:06:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出！大家都出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.73,1:06:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把麦克风给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme the mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.85,1:06:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，布罗迪！回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Brody! Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.94,1:06:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从水里出来！ 把它拿进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta the water! Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.19,1:06:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿进来！ 把船拉进来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in! Bring the boat in!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.40,1:06:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上离开水！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the water right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.24,1:06:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了，起来！一个两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready, up! One. Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.41,1:06:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船弄进来！ 马上离开水！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring that boat in! Get outta the water right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.20,1:06:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，把我弄下来！ 把我弄下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get me down! Just get me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.08,1:06:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我弄下来！ 你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me down! What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.25,1:06:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面有东西！ 鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something back there! A shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.17,1:06:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的船带进来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your boat in!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.76,1:07:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一条鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.28,1:07:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一，二，三， 四，五，六，七\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.82,1:07:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从水里出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.58,1:07:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.12,1:07:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从水里出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.97,1:07:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.63,1:07:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来了！ 我们回来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming! We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.84,1:07:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会吃掉我们的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna eat us!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.89,1:07:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll die!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.27,1:07:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手给我快点！ 把我拉出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme your hand. Come on! Pull me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.19,1:07:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.78,1:08:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要窒息 或者别的什么拉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needs a choke or something. Pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.63,1:08:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,握住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.51,1:08:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利！ 鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly! Shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.85,1:08:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.90,1:08:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.90,1:08:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？ 倒霉！坚持！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that? Shit! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.88,1:09:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？她快淹死了！ 她快淹死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? She's drowning! She's drowning!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.39,1:09:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,游泳！游泳，孩子，游泳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim! Swim, kid, swim!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.28,1:09:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.07,1:09:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅速地来吧 让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly. Come on. Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.24,1:09:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给我们一些房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us some room there, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.12,1:09:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个医护人员！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a paramedic!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.37,1:09:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点，妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.96,1:09:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.21,1:09:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫救护车了吗？ 是的，医护人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call an ambulance? Yeah, the paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.09,1:09:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭动止血带 紧紧地抓住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twist that tourniquet tight and hold it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.09,1:09:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.47,1:09:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here. You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.80,1:09:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些 在水中受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still some injured in the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把伤员带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bringin' in the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.35,1:09:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护车在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambulance is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.89,1:09:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让大门开着吗？ 辛迪和桑迪在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I leave the gate open? Cindy and Sandy are out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.81,1:09:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.40,1:10:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他们必须 照顾好自己，利兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They're gonna have to take care of themselves, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.82,1:10:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能冒险 在那个大婊子身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take our chance on that big bitch gettin' in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.61,1:10:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你还好吧？ 是啊是啊我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you all right? Yeah. Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，我要和凯莉一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm gonna go with Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.54,1:10:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.25,1:10:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办？ 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.26,1:10:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 我是卡尔文？布沙尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello out there. This is Calvin Bouchard.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.97,1:10:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以吗 请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I please have your kind attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.97,1:10:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于技术上的困难，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to technical difficulties,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.51,1:10:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们来说是必要的 暂时关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}it has become necessary for us to temporarily close.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.02,1:10:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,海底王国现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Undersea Kingdom now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.98,1:10:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你们所有人 这个公园的水下部分，\N{\fnArial\fs30}For those of you all still in the underwater portion of this park,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.82,1:10:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请遵循您的指导，\N{\fnArial\fs30}please follow your guides,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.53,1:10:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会指出 方便且无障碍的出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will point out the most convenient and accessible exits.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.41,1:10:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的地方在哪 无障碍出口？我们在水下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is the nearest accessible exit? We're underwater!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.49,1:10:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,关了吗？ 啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this off? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.50,1:10:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我下面的灯！ 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme some lights down there! Got them right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.33,1:10:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不到下面的屎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't see shit down there!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.54,1:11:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我拿点药 注意这里，快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me some medical attention here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.13,1:11:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，女士们先生们，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.59,1:11:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都听到通知了， 所以请跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you all heard the announcement, so please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.01,1:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,以有序的方式， 记住走路，不要跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an orderly fashion, and remember walk, do not run.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.02,1:11:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸，爸爸！ 看那条鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, Daddy! Look at the fish!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.77,1:11:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！ 天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.42,1:11:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道故障，6号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tunnel failure, number six.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.59,1:11:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是约拿和鲸鱼 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Jonah and the Whale. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,管道完整性 妥协的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tube integrity has been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.05,1:11:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有漏洞 以及压力损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got leakage and pressure loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得封锁这个区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to seal the section.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.10,1:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们会失去整个情结\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we'll lose the whole complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.73,1:12:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,水密门击中它 自动启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watertight doors. Hit it. On automatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.40,1:12:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是随叫随到的人 激活现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all on go status. Activated. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.45,1:12:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要我的钱包！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my wallet!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.48,1:12:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静的！安静的！拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet! Quiet! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.15,1:12:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的注意， 拜托安静的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your attention, please. Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.65,1:12:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在水不流了 再高一点，冷静点，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the water is not going any higher, so calm down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.57,1:12:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它停止了信息技术 停下来，冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stopped. It's stopped, so calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.37,1:13:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的氧气 我们只有这里，\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oxygen that we have in here is all we have,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.16,1:13:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，让我们不要惊慌，而要尝试 浅呼吸，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's not panic, but let's try to take shallow breaths, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.81,1:13:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，迈克 - 是啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Mike. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.89,1:13:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们最后一次切我想我们 隧道补丁已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our last cut. I think our tunnel patch is ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.31,1:13:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好安装绞盘 在上面的工作船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Rig the winch on that work boat up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.11,1:13:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.78,1:13:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多久，亲爱的？ 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer, sweetie? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.32,1:13:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.45,1:13:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将不得不推动这些 隧道段在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to nudge these tunnel sections together.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.29,1:13:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们要打补丁 我们要把整个焊接起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're gonna slap on a patch and we're gonna weld the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.37,1:13:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们撤离？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we evacuate?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.71,1:13:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，那我们得施加压力 回到隧道里，\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, then we gotta put pressure back into the tunnels,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.08,1:13:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么水密门就会 打开门，然后人们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the watertight doors will open up, then people go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.34,1:13:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，看你怎么把那东西切下来！ 很关键！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, watch how you're cutting that thing! It's critical!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.18,1:13:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点放松点你在做什么 尽你所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. Relax. You're doing everything you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.72,1:13:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.85,1:14:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听 我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.19,1:14:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许委内瑞拉可以利用 一些训练有素的鲸鱼，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Venezuela can use some trained whales, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.73,1:14:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你是认真的吗？ 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Are you serious? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.19,1:14:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这件事由我负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this one's on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.24,1:14:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但明年 我会跟你到任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But next year… I'll follow you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.57,1:14:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！ 我爱你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.33,1:14:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，格拉斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Glass.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.75,1:14:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是布查德先生吗 会在这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Mr. Bouchard going to be here?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.75,1:14:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，拜托 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please. I have a statement to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.88,1:14:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有爆炸吗？ 那火呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there an explosion? What about the fire?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.67,1:14:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人失踪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people are missing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.26,1:14:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午晚些时候 小干扰的结果，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late this afternoon, as a result of a minor disturbance,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.18,1:14:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个压力故障 水下隧道之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a pressure failure in one of the underwater tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.93,1:14:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个主要的吸引力 在公园里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that are a major attraction here at the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.60,1:14:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们估计有30到40个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We estimate that 30 to 40 people.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.48,1:14:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在进行中 被疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}were in the process of being evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.36,1:14:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当水密安全门 暂时推迟了他们的离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the watertight safety doors temporarily delayed their exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.03,1:14:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在正在工作 释放他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working right now to release them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.20,1:14:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最安全的情况下 可能的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the safest possible circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.49,1:15:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,此外，还有7位访客 在我们的海滩上受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In addition, seven visitors were injured in our beach area.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.20,1:15:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就这些了 孩子们，让我休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all for now. Give me a break, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.50,1:15:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说了什么 关于一条大鲨鱼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this we've heard about a large shark?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.21,1:15:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你知道我知道的更多 一条很大的鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know as I know more. A very large shark…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.59,1:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已再也没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all. There is no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.30,1:15:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么时候能修好这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will they get this fixed?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.63,1:15:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他们正在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.93,1:15:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在一起保暖 我知道你很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay together to keep warm. I know you're cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.80,1:15:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在一起，深呼吸 集中精力呼吸，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay together, take shallow breaths and concentrate on your breathing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.20,1:15:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，有妈妈的迹象吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, any sign of mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.66,1:15:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.75,1:15:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物在哪 第一次躲起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did the animal hide the first time?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.09,1:15:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,休斯敦大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:15:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,过滤管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filtration pipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.13,1:16:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,泻湖的对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opposite side of the lagoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.64,1:16:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,布罗迪，有通道吗 舱口，反洗门？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody, is there an access hatch, a backwash gate?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.52,1:16:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重的烤架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy grillwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.81,1:16:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当 我们反冲洗那个系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps the pumps clear when we back-flush that system.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.40,1:16:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？你想做什么？ 把那东西拿回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What do you want to do? Get that thing back in?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.03,1:16:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个聪明的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bright lad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.69,1:16:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对杰克和我要 把他引回烟斗里，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Jack and I are going to lure him back into the pipe,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.49,1:16:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上门然后 我们有空就把他处理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}close the gates and then dispose of him at our leisure.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.66,1:16:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时，你可以焊接 你的隧道补丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, you can weld your tunnel patch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.41,1:16:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后卡尔文可以 疏散平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then Calvin can evacuate the civilians.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.88,1:16:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她不做呢&apos；t 想回去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she doesn't want to go back in?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.13,1:16:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我想我们可以 保证她会想回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think we can pretty much guarantee she'll want to go back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.22,1:16:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，杰克？ 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you, Jack? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.26,1:16:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 会保证吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just how are you going to guarantee that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.35,1:16:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,活饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.77,1:16:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好行动了 现在在隧道那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready to move out over the tunnel now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.69,1:16:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.41,1:17:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在控制室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in the Control Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.45,1:17:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.75,1:17:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个给我 让我把它放在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that. Let me stow it over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.71,1:17:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.96,1:17:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我们在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.71,1:17:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.72,1:17:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，那条该死的鱼在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where's that damn fish?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.81,1:17:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里我抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.81,1:17:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，只是海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, it's just the dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.90,1:17:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝们，请不要插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies, stay out of it, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.03,1:17:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经安装了救生索\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've rigged a lifeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.74,1:17:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让泵把你推出去用 把你拉回来的绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let the pumps push you out and use the rope to pull yourself back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.04,1:17:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.62,1:17:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不 我拍所有的电影？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why don't I do all the filming?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.84,1:18:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要两个摄像头我们需要保险 快点，杰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want both cameras. We need the coverage. Come on, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.51,1:18:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是野餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a picnic.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.26,1:18:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部电影太血腥了 退休年金\N{\fnArial\fs30}This film is a bloody retirement annuity.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.34,1:18:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能 只做了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd feel better if you did just the one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.22,1:18:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.22,1:18:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚发冷了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting cold feet?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.11,1:18:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，鲍勃别动 就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Bob. Hold it about right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.90,1:18:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在隧道的正上方 好吧，我们都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're right over the tunnel. Okay, we're all set down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.62,1:18:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉菲茨罗伊斯 我们已就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell FitzRoyce we 're in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.53,1:18:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲茨罗伊斯，你现在可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}FitzRoyce, you can go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.65,1:19:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们重新测试生命线 看看它是否安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're testing the lifeline to see if it's secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.88,1:19:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是些密友 你知道，鱼油和血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're spreadin' some chum. You know, fish oil and blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.47,1:19:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杰克会 一些金属的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Jack's gonna make some metallic sounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.18,1:19:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她吸引下来 进入过滤管\N{\fnArial\fs30}to attract her right down into that filtration pipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.10,1:19:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the pumps.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.52,1:19:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.90,1:21:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它进来了！ - 他明白了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's in! - He's got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.45,1:21:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧它已锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.20,1:21:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安全，布罗迪 去争取吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe, Brody. Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.49,1:21:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.87,1:22:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是控制 那条隧道有没有修好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Control. Is that tunnel patch in place?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.59,1:22:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,容易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.06,1:23:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你 说完了，摩根医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you with that, Dr. Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.18,1:23:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.56,1:23:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在焊接 狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now weld the son-of-a-bitch…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.73,1:23:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳，你在干什么；？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn, what are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.23,1:23:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.20,1:23:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.41,1:23:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要眼睛在后面 他的头，卡尔文\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs eyes in the back of his head, Calvin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.04,1:23:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，弗雷德 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Fred. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.46,1:23:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.92,1:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.01,1:23:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的鳍 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are your fins. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.26,1:23:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful down there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.18,1:24:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.40,1:24:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲茨罗伊斯先生在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mr. FitzRoyce?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.02,1:24:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.90,1:24:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.16,1:24:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guv'nor!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.16,1:24:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guv'nor!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.16,1:24:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guv'nor!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.46,1:24:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有其他出路了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other way out?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.25,1:24:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 就这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.08,1:24:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you looked?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.17,1:24:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't come up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.76,1:25:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是，你这个该死的混蛋 回答我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guv'nor, you bloody bastard. Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.72,1:25:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让那婊子窒息的 关闭泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll suffocate the bitch. Shut down the pumps.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.56,1:25:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.19,1:25:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么不炸掉它？ 听着，侄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we blow it up? Listen, nephew.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.02,1:25:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一台250万美元的涡轮机 因为一些该死的鱼而冒烟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a $2.5 million turbine that's not going up in smoke because of some damn fish!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.15,1:25:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在关闭泵！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now shut the pumps down!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.70,1:25:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.20,1:25:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经把水泵关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've shut the pumps off.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.71,1:25:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只需要这些 大门关不上多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all she needs. The gates can't hold much longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.46,1:25:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普，拔出别针！ 拔出别针，菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philip, pull the pin! Pull the pin, Philip.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.55,1:27:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.68,1:27:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.89,1:27:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.15,1:27:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得警告他们 我们得告诉他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta warn 'em. We gotta tell 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.36,1:27:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.57,1:27:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它回来了 快起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming back. Get 'em up quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.82,1:27:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！ 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hurry up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.57,1:27:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.96,1:27:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，迈克 出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mike. Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.72,1:27:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点，迈克！ - 起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Mike! - Get 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.33,1:28:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.82,1:29:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.77,1:30:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会松了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did it get loose?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.15,1:30:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开舱门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.58,1:30:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来吧， 迈克我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on up, Mike. I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.17,1:30:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.59,1:30:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有压力吗 在那些隧道里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have pressure in those tunnels yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.01,1:30:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的然后打开舱壁， 把那些人弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affirmative. Then open up the bulkheads, get those people out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.09,1:30:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.51,1:30:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受空气！ 你能感觉到空气吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the air! Can you feel the air?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.89,1:30:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,水在往下流 水要沉了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water's going down. The water's going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.32,1:30:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量保持冷静 不要冲到门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to be calm. Don't rush to the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.61,1:30:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重新得救了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.61,1:34:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！我们做到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.66,1:34:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人，迈克 其他的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others, Mike. What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.24,1:34:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文成功了丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin made it. Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.54,1:34:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克迈克！海豚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike. Mike! The dolphins!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.38,1:34:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.09,1:34:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 辛迪！ - 桑迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cindy! - Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.38,1:34:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，姑娘们！辛迪！ 辛迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls! Cindy! Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.80,1:34:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，好女孩桑迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good girl. Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.47,1:34:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑迪，来吧，宝贝 桑迪，你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandy, come on, baby. Sandy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.43,1:34:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,美琪桑迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}MIKEI Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.65,1:34:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望她成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope she made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.44,1:35:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪，留下来 桑迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cindy, stay. Sandy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.78,1:35:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.16,1:35:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.13,1:35:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
